WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.346 --> 00:00:16.788
and Wayan left the racing field.

2
00:00:17.848 --> 00:00:21.549
They tied the oxen to a tree and walked up the mountain.

3
00:00:21.569 --> 00:00:23.950
"Where are we going?"

4
00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:27.071
Vinnie asked as they went higher.

5
00:00:27.091 --> 00:00:32.200
"To my favorite spot," said Wayan.

6
00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:33.922
The boys stopped to rest.

7
00:00:33.942 --> 00:00:37.905
"Wow!" Vinnie gasped.

8
00:00:37.925 --> 00:00:41.389
"I can see everything from up here!"

9
00:00:42.530 --> 00:00:45.252
He was looking down at the village and ocean.

10
00:00:47.014 --> 00:00:48.955
Wayan laughed.

11
00:00:49.256 --> 00:00:56.302
"From here, everything—the mountains, the sea, the village—looks connected.

12
00:00:57.603 --> 00:01:03.589
In Bali, everything we build and do is based on this idea of connection," he said.

13
00:01:03.609 --> 00:01:07.290
"I don't understand," said Vinnie.

14
00:01:07.310 --> 00:01:13.832
"To be happy, people should live in harmony with nature, the gods, and each other.

15
00:01:14.973 --> 00:01:22.295
My father says that harmony with those three things is necessary for a good life," continued Wayan.

16
00:01:23.295 --> 00:01:27.156
Back at the village, the adults were ready to hold their meeting.

17
00:01:28.308 --> 00:01:31.110
"Mandy, come home with me," said Nyoman.

18
00:01:32.291 --> 00:01:34.093
"We can get ready for the festival."

19
00:01:34.113 --> 00:01:39.217
"Sure," replied Mandy, walking with her new friend.

20
00:01:40.338 --> 00:01:44.762
The homes reminded Mandy of the courtyard houses she had seen in China.

21
00:01:44.782 --> 00:01:52.468
Nyoman pointed out that every family had separate areas for different activities.

22
00:01:52.488 --> 00:01:56.672
"We sleep and eat in different places.

23
00:01:58.188 --> 00:02:01.330
There's also a building for ceremonies and a guest house.

24
00:02:02.571 --> 00:02:04.833
The wall is to keep out evil forces."

25
00:02:05.854 --> 00:02:08.516
Then Nyoman asked, "Are you hungry?"

26
00:02:08.536 --> 00:02:11.658
"Yes," said Mandy.

27
00:02:12.879 --> 00:02:16.141
Suddenly Nyoman climbed up a tall tree.

28
00:02:16.161 --> 00:02:18.243
"Watch your head!"

29
00:02:18.743 --> 00:02:21.205
she called, and she dropped a coconut.

30
00:02:22.225 --> 00:02:23.366
It broke in half.

31
00:02:24.007 --> 00:02:28.206
Nyoman climbed down, and the girls shared the delicious fruit.

32
00:02:28.226 --> 00:02:33.390
"I love climbing trees," giggled Nyoman.

33
00:02:33.410 --> 00:02:35.452
"Can I try?"

34
00:02:36.033 --> 00:02:36.733
asked Mandy.

35
00:02:36.753 --> 00:02:44.460
Nyoman led her to a smaller tree with green bananas and said, "Climb this one."

36
00:02:45.801 --> 00:02:49.524
Mandy was about to climb when she heard loud screeching.

37
00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:55.903
A few monkeys scrambled down a tree and started chasing the girls.

38
00:02:57.444 --> 00:03:04.347
Laughing, Nyoman and Mandy ran until they reached the rice field behind Nyoman's house.

39
00:03:05.528 --> 00:03:08.950
There Mandy noticed a miniature house on a pole.

40
00:03:10.070 --> 00:03:12.391
Grains of rice were sprinkled inside.

41
00:03:12.411 --> 00:03:15.073
"What is this?"

42
00:03:15.693 --> 00:03:16.274
she asked.

43
00:03:16.294 --> 00:03:21.788
"A rice field temple," explained Nyoman.

44
00:03:21.808 --> 00:03:24.590
"Rice farmers give rice grains to the Rice Mother.

45
00:03:25.651 --> 00:03:27.953
She is the most loved goddess in Bali."

46
00:03:27.973 --> 00:03:31.216
"Wow," said Mandy.

47
00:03:31.236 --> 00:03:34.999
"There are a lot of temples in Bali!"

48
00:03:35.019 --> 00:03:37.381
"Every family has one.

49
00:03:38.482 --> 00:03:41.344
Every village has one too," said Nyoman.

50
00:03:41.364 --> 00:03:48.490
"There are mountain temples and river temples Bali is called the island of a thousand temples."

51
00:03:50.111 --> 00:03:54.693
Back on the mountain, Vinnie and Wayan were ready to return to the village.

52
00:03:55.774 --> 00:03:58.415
Suddenly Vinnie felt the ground shake.

53
00:03:58.435 --> 00:04:01.836
"Whoa! What's that?"

54
00:04:02.417 --> 00:04:03.137
he shouted.

55
00:04:04.277 --> 00:04:06.718
A low sound rumbled like thunder.

56
00:04:06.738 --> 00:04:11.761
"The mountain is not happy," said Wayan worriedly.

57
00:04:11.781 --> 00:04:13.921
"What do you mean?"

58
00:04:14.462 --> 00:04:15.162
asked Vinnie.

59
00:04:15.182 --> 00:04:20.873
"The god who lives in the mountain is upset," said Wayan.

60
00:04:20.893 --> 00:04:22.358
The ground shook harder.

61
00:04:22.378 --> 00:04:25.229
"Let's get out of here!"

62
00:04:25.931 --> 00:04:26.775
shouted Vinnie.
